{"source":"tts","voice":"piper it_IT-serena-medium","durationSec":71.482,"sentences":[{"text":"Sono Ginevra de' Benci, di Firenze.","start":0,"end":2.241,"words":[{"w":"Sono","start":0,"end":0.34},{"w":"Ginevra","start":0.34,"end":0.883},{"w":"de","start":0.883,"end":1.086},{"w":"Benci","start":1.086,"end":1.494},{"w":"di","start":1.494,"end":1.698},{"w":"Firenze","start":1.698,"end":2.241}],"paragraph":0},{"text":"Mio padre era Amerigo de' Benci, un ricco banchiere.","start":2.691,"end":5.733,"words":[{"w":"Mio","start":2.691,"end":2.934},{"w":"padre","start":2.934,"end":3.299},{"w":"era","start":3.299,"end":3.542},{"w":"Amerigo","start":3.542,"end":4.029},{"w":"de","start":4.029,"end":4.212},{"w":"Benci","start":4.212,"end":4.577},{"w":"un","start":4.577,"end":4.759},{"w":"ricco","start":4.759,"end":5.124},{"w":"banchiere","start":5.124,"end":5.733}],"paragraph":0},{"text":"Leonardo da Vinci mi ha ritratta quando ero giovane, tra il 1474 e il 1478.","start":6.183,"end":13.067,"words":[{"w":"Leonardo","start":6.183,"end":7.02},{"w":"da","start":7.02,"end":7.299},{"w":"Vinci","start":7.299,"end":7.857},{"w":"mi","start":7.857,"end":8.136},{"w":"ha","start":8.136,"end":8.415},{"w":"ritratta","start":8.415,"end":9.253},{"w":"quando","start":9.253,"end":9.904},{"w":"ero","start":9.904,"end":10.276},{"w":"giovane","start":10.276,"end":11.02},{"w":"tra","start":11.02,"end":11.393},{"w":"il","start":11.393,"end":11.672},{"w":"1474","start":11.672,"end":12.137},{"w":"e","start":12.137,"end":12.323},{"w":"il","start":12.323,"end":12.602},{"w":"1478","start":12.602,"end":13.067}],"paragraph":0},{"text":"Proprio nel 1474 mi sposai con Luigi Niccolini.","start":13.967,"end":17.938,"words":[{"w":"Proprio","start":13.967,"end":14.643},{"w":"nel","start":14.643,"end":14.981},{"w":"1474","start":14.981,"end":15.403},{"w":"mi","start":15.403,"end":15.657},{"w":"sposai","start":15.657,"end":16.248},{"w":"con","start":16.248,"end":16.586},{"w":"Luigi","start":16.586,"end":17.093},{"w":"Niccolini","start":17.093,"end":17.938}],"paragraph":1},{"text":"Forse questo ritratto ricorda quel momento, o forse il mio fidanzamento.","start":18.388,"end":22.312,"words":[{"w":"Forse","start":18.388,"end":18.719},{"w":"questo","start":18.719,"end":19.106},{"w":"ritratto","start":19.106,"end":19.604},{"w":"ricorda","start":19.604,"end":20.046},{"w":"quel","start":20.046,"end":20.322},{"w":"momento","start":20.322,"end":20.764},{"w":"o","start":20.764,"end":20.875},{"w":"forse","start":20.875,"end":21.207},{"w":"il","start":21.207,"end":21.372},{"w":"mio","start":21.372,"end":21.594},{"w":"fidanzamento","start":21.594,"end":22.312}],"paragraph":1},{"text":"Dietro di me vedi un cespuglio di ginepro.","start":23.212,"end":25.313,"words":[{"w":"Dietro","start":23.212,"end":23.562},{"w":"di","start":23.562,"end":23.712},{"w":"me","start":23.712,"end":23.862},{"w":"vedi","start":23.862,"end":24.113},{"w":"un","start":24.113,"end":24.263},{"w":"cespuglio","start":24.263,"end":24.763},{"w":"di","start":24.763,"end":24.913},{"w":"ginepro","start":24.913,"end":25.313}],"paragraph":2},{"text":"Non è un caso: la parola ginepro somiglia al mio nome, Ginevra, e il ginepro era anche un simbolo di virtù.","start":25.763,"end":31.777,"words":[{"w":"Non","start":25.763,"end":25.995},{"w":"è","start":25.995,"end":26.11},{"w":"un","start":26.11,"end":26.284},{"w":"caso","start":26.284,"end":26.573},{"w":"la","start":26.573,"end":26.746},{"w":"parola","start":26.746,"end":27.151},{"w":"ginepro","start":27.151,"end":27.614},{"w":"somiglia","start":27.614,"end":28.134},{"w":"al","start":28.134,"end":28.308},{"w":"mio","start":28.308,"end":28.539},{"w":"nome","start":28.539,"end":28.828},{"w":"Ginevra","start":28.828,"end":29.291},{"w":"e","start":29.291,"end":29.407},{"w":"il","start":29.407,"end":29.58},{"w":"ginepro","start":29.58,"end":30.043},{"w":"era","start":30.043,"end":30.274},{"w":"anche","start":30.274,"end":30.621},{"w":"un","start":30.621,"end":30.794},{"w":"simbolo","start":30.794,"end":31.257},{"w":"di","start":31.257,"end":31.43},{"w":"virtù","start":31.43,"end":31.777}],"paragraph":2},{"text":"Se giri la tavola, sul retro trovi un rametto di ginepro dentro una corona di alloro e di palma, con un motto in latino: «Virtutem forma decorat».","start":32.677,"end":40.77,"words":[{"w":"Se","start":32.677,"end":32.85},{"w":"giri","start":32.85,"end":33.137},{"w":"la","start":33.137,"end":33.309},{"w":"tavola","start":33.309,"end":33.71},{"w":"sul","start":33.71,"end":33.94},{"w":"retro","start":33.94,"end":34.284},{"w":"trovi","start":34.284,"end":34.629},{"w":"un","start":34.629,"end":34.801},{"w":"rametto","start":34.801,"end":35.26},{"w":"di","start":35.26,"end":35.432},{"w":"ginepro","start":35.432,"end":35.891},{"w":"dentro","start":35.891,"end":36.293},{"w":"una","start":36.293,"end":36.523},{"w":"corona","start":36.523,"end":36.924},{"w":"di","start":36.924,"end":37.097},{"w":"alloro","start":37.097,"end":37.498},{"w":"e","start":37.498,"end":37.613},{"w":"di","start":37.613,"end":37.785},{"w":"palma","start":37.785,"end":38.13},{"w":"con","start":38.13,"end":38.359},{"w":"un","start":38.359,"end":38.531},{"w":"motto","start":38.531,"end":38.876},{"w":"in","start":38.876,"end":39.048},{"w":"latino","start":39.048,"end":39.45},{"w":"Virtutem","start":39.45,"end":39.966},{"w":"forma","start":39.966,"end":40.31},{"w":"decorat","start":40.31,"end":40.77}],"paragraph":3},{"text":"Te lo traduco: «la bellezza adorna la virtù».","start":41.22,"end":43.681,"words":[{"w":"Te","start":41.22,"end":41.395},{"w":"lo","start":41.395,"end":41.571},{"w":"traduco","start":41.571,"end":42.04},{"w":"la","start":42.04,"end":42.216},{"w":"bellezza","start":42.216,"end":42.743},{"w":"adorna","start":42.743,"end":43.153},{"w":"la","start":43.153,"end":43.329},{"w":"virtù","start":43.329,"end":43.681}],"paragraph":3},{"text":"L'alloro e la palma ricordano l'emblema di Bernardo Bembo, un ambasciatore veneziano che mi scriveva.","start":44.131,"end":49.355,"words":[{"w":"L'alloro","start":44.131,"end":44.601},{"w":"e","start":44.601,"end":44.706},{"w":"la","start":44.706,"end":44.862},{"w":"palma","start":44.862,"end":45.176},{"w":"ricordano","start":45.176,"end":45.698},{"w":"l'emblema","start":45.698,"end":46.221},{"w":"di","start":46.221,"end":46.377},{"w":"Bernardo","start":46.377,"end":46.848},{"w":"Bembo","start":46.848,"end":47.161},{"w":"un","start":47.161,"end":47.318},{"w":"ambasciatore","start":47.318,"end":47.997},{"w":"veneziano","start":47.997,"end":48.519},{"w":"che","start":48.519,"end":48.728},{"w":"mi","start":48.728,"end":48.885},{"w":"scriveva","start":48.885,"end":49.355}],"paragraph":3},{"text":"Forse hai notato che il quadro sembra tagliato in basso.","start":50.255,"end":52.891,"words":[{"w":"Forse","start":50.255,"end":50.538},{"w":"hai","start":50.538,"end":50.726},{"w":"notato","start":50.726,"end":51.055},{"w":"che","start":51.055,"end":51.244},{"w":"il","start":51.244,"end":51.385},{"w":"quadro","start":51.385,"end":51.714},{"w":"sembra","start":51.714,"end":52.044},{"w":"tagliato","start":52.044,"end":52.467},{"w":"in","start":52.467,"end":52.608},{"w":"basso","start":52.608,"end":52.891}],"paragraph":4},{"text":"Un tempo la tavola era più lunga e probabilmente mostrava anche le mie mani, ma quella parte è andata perduta.","start":53.341,"end":59.471,"words":[{"w":"Un","start":53.341,"end":53.51},{"w":"tempo","start":53.51,"end":53.847},{"w":"la","start":53.847,"end":54.016},{"w":"tavola","start":54.016,"end":54.409},{"w":"era","start":54.409,"end":54.634},{"w":"più","start":54.634,"end":54.859},{"w":"lunga","start":54.859,"end":55.197},{"w":"e","start":55.197,"end":55.309},{"w":"probabilmente","start":55.309,"end":56.097},{"w":"mostrava","start":56.097,"end":56.603},{"w":"anche","start":56.603,"end":56.94},{"w":"le","start":56.94,"end":57.109},{"w":"mie","start":57.109,"end":57.334},{"w":"mani","start":57.334,"end":57.615},{"w":"ma","start":57.615,"end":57.784},{"w":"quella","start":57.784,"end":58.177},{"w":"parte","start":58.177,"end":58.515},{"w":"è","start":58.515,"end":58.627},{"w":"andata","start":58.627,"end":59.021},{"w":"perduta","start":59.021,"end":59.471}],"paragraph":4},{"text":"Oggi sono a Washington, nella National Gallery of Art, che mi ha acquistata nel 1967 dal principe del Liechtenstein.","start":60.371,"end":67.999,"words":[{"w":"Oggi","start":60.371,"end":60.705},{"w":"sono","start":60.705,"end":61.04},{"w":"a","start":61.04,"end":61.174},{"w":"Washington","start":61.174,"end":61.91},{"w":"nella","start":61.91,"end":62.311},{"w":"National","start":62.311,"end":62.913},{"w":"Gallery","start":62.913,"end":63.449},{"w":"of","start":63.449,"end":63.65},{"w":"Art","start":63.65,"end":63.917},{"w":"che","start":63.917,"end":64.185},{"w":"mi","start":64.185,"end":64.386},{"w":"ha","start":64.386,"end":64.586},{"w":"acquistata","start":64.586,"end":65.322},{"w":"nel","start":65.322,"end":65.59},{"w":"1967","start":65.59,"end":65.924},{"w":"dal","start":65.924,"end":66.192},{"w":"principe","start":66.192,"end":66.794},{"w":"del","start":66.794,"end":67.062},{"w":"Liechtenstein","start":67.062,"end":67.999}],"paragraph":5},{"text":"Se vuoi, fammi una domanda.","start":68.899,"end":70.582,"words":[{"w":"Se","start":68.899,"end":69.093},{"w":"vuoi","start":69.093,"end":69.417},{"w":"fammi","start":69.417,"end":69.805},{"w":"una","start":69.805,"end":70.064},{"w":"domanda","start":70.064,"end":70.582}],"paragraph":6}]}